{"id":"8848af608d92d92b","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem.md","title":"Recursive Set Characterization Theorem","display":"thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem — Recursive Set Characterization Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem"],"display":"thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem — Recursive Set Characterization Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-recursive-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§14.6 p.51 / PDF 60","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-local-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem — Recursive Set Characterization Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§14.6 p.51 / PDF 60"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-local-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar A:=\\mathbb N\\setminus A\">\\(\\bar A:=\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\bar A\\in\\mathrm{RE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\bar A\\in\\mathrm{RE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 14.6，印刷 p.51 / PDF p.60。正向用可判定性半判定 A 与补集；反向交替模拟两套半判定过程，对每个 x 恰有一个停机，故可全判定。本地证明完整，原书另以 Graph Theorem 证明，亦已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\bar A:=\\mathbb N\\setminus A$。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-recursive-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\bar A:=\\mathbb N\\setminus A$。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-recursive-set]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar A:=\\mathbb N\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recursive}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Recursive}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\bar A\\in\\mathrm{RE}.","display":true}],"bytes":1225,"backlinks":[{"id":"c3a69f59b70a4436","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem|thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem — Recursive Set Characterization Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["913d52943499d039","7fc8baae87b873a3"]}